#. module: approval_account_telegram
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/approval_account_telegram/services/approval_notifier.py:0
msgid ""
"To approve it, link the bank transaction that shows the payment, in Odoo: it"
" cannot be approved from here without it."
msgstr ""
"Para aprobarla, vincula en Odoo el movimiento bancario que muestra el pago: "
"sin él no puede aprobarse desde aquí."
